WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.462
Meet Dhaan Saathi, a free, offline rice photo checker.

2
00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:08.000
This experimental app needs field testing.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.913
Take a clear photo of the rice plant.

4
00:00:12.913 --> 00:00:19.000
The checker runs on your phone, without an internet
connection.

5
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.011
The result is a model suggestion, not a confirmed
diagnosis.

6
00:00:25.011 --> 00:00:31.000
It may confuse diseases, damage, or nutrient problems.

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.965
Results stay silent by default.

8
00:00:34.965 --> 00:00:38.994
Tap Hear results if you want speech.

9
00:00:38.994 --> 00:00:43.000
Use Stop speaking to end playback.

10
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.061
Home returns to the starting screen for another photo.

11
00:00:47.061 --> 00:00:52.000
Close exits the app. These are separate controls.

12
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.830
Use English or Hindi.

13
00:00:55.830 --> 00:01:02.000
Read the result on screen, or choose to hear it when you
need spoken help.

14
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.176
The checker can be confidently wrong.

15
00:01:06.176 --> 00:01:11.271
A healthy result is not proof that a plant is
disease-free.

16
00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:17.000
Ask a local agricultural expert to assess suspected
problems.

17
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.547
We welcome agricultural organisations and rice growers

18
00:01:21.547 --> 00:01:27.000
who can help evaluate this experimental tool under real
field conditions.

19
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:33.170
Dhaan Saathi. A project by Dr. Chindanoor Rajesh.

20
00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:38.000
Find out more at abilityenhancerapps.com.
